nimxev(7) "github.com/mitchellh/libxev" "Miscellaneous Information Manual"

# NAME

nimxev - high-performance cross-platform event loop for Nim

# DESCRIPTION

nimxev is a high-performance cross-platform event loop for Nim. It provides an
idiomatic Nim abstraction for non-blocking I/O, timers, async notifications,
and thread pools across Linux, macOS, BSD, WASI, and Windows.

# SEE ALSO

xev-nim(7)
